' Relationships
GameEngine ..|> ISceneRouter
GameEngine --> VideoManager : borrows
GameEngine --> IClock : borrows
GameEngine --> Scene : owns and drives

Scene --> SceneServices : borrows
Scene --> EntityManager : owns
Scene --> Action : dispatches
Action --> ActionState : state

SceneServices --> VideoManager
SceneServices --> FontManager
SceneServices --> TextureManager
SceneServices --> AudioSampleBuffer
SceneServices --> AudioManager
SceneServices --> IClock
SceneServices --> ISceneRouter

SdlClock ..|> IClock
AudioManager ..|> IAudioSink
AudioManager --> AudioInitOptions : constructed from
AudioInitOptions *-- AudioTrackDefinition
AudioInitOptions *-- AudioSampleDefinition

AudioSampleBuffer *-- QueuedSample : buffer
AudioSampleBuffer --> IAudioSink : plays through
AudioSampleBuffer --> IClock : reads time from
QueuedSample --> PriorityLevel : priority

TextureManager --> RendererHandle : constructed from
FontManager --> FontSizes : opens at

ConfigAdapter --|> ConfigReader
ConfigReader --> ConfigStore : reads
ConfigAdapter --> GameConfig : returns
ConfigStore --> IConfigProvider : owns
ConfigStore --> ConfigDictionary : caches into
JsonConfigProvider ..|> IConfigProvider
EmptyConfigProvider ..|> IConfigProvider
JsonConfigProvider --> ConfigDictionary : fills
AudioManifestLoader --> AudioManifest : returns
AudioManifest *-- AudioInitOptions
VideoManager --> ConfigAdapter : reads window settings

EntityManager --> Entity : creates and manages
EntityManager --> ComponentRegistry : owns
Entity --> EntityTags : tagged with
Entity --> ComponentRegistry : reads and writes
ComponentRegistry *-- ComponentPool : one per component type
CInput --> Directions : indexes
CEffects --> Effect : stores
Effect --> EffectTypes : type

RenderSystem --> EntityManager : draws
RenderSystem --> VideoManager : draws into
RenderSystem --> TextureManager : resolves sprites
TextHelpers --> TextAlign : alignment

note left of GameEngine
  Runs the frame loop and owns the scenes.
  Collaborators are handed in by the game's
  main, which is the composition root.
end note

note right of SceneServices
  A game extends this bundle with its own
  collaborators, as PongServices and
  DemoServices do with their config adapters.
end note

note right of EntityTags
  EntityTag is a uint32_t. The engine names
  only the shared tags; a game claims its own
  kinds from FirstGameTag upwards.
end note

@enduml
